      "body": "A similar reproducer run was executed, with receiver-side forced chunking of data: #36751 .\n\nTest failures identified there, with some CI runs where they failed, are:\n\n- `sock_tests/send_and_receive` unit test. A unit test failure prevented execution of the integration tests, so a fix was included in the reproducer PR as well. It still fails in the per-commit checks [log](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126966108982?pr=36751).\n\n- `interface_http.py` Failed many times. Three logs are included here: [1](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126971553187?pr=36751) [2](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126966109177?pr=36751) [3](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126966109312?pr=36751).\n\n- `feature_torcontrol.py` Failed in two windows tests ([1](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126971553187?pr=36751) [2](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/41942374316/job/126966108876?pr=36751))\n",
